            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Летом мы собираемся на море. Létom my sobiráyemsya na móre. In the summer we are planning to go to the seaside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Imperfective; perfective собраться. With an infinitive, to intend: я собираюсь уехать. It also means to gather: гости собираются."
